#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:2684
msgid ""
"A shared secret BuddyNext uses to sign outgoing webhooks (HMAC-SHA256) and "
"to verify inbound access requests at POST buddynext/v1/webhook/access. "
"Click Rotate for a new strong secret, then Save - the old value stops "
"working, so copy the new one into your receiving service (Slack, Zapier, "
"your endpoint). Leave blank to disable signature verification."
msgstr ""
"Un secreto compartido que BuddyNext usa para firmar webhooks salientes "
"(HMAC-SHA256) y verificar solicitudes de acceso entrantes en POST "
"buddynext/v1/webhook/access. Haz clic en Rotar para obtener un nuevo "
"secreto fuerte, luego Guardar - el valor antiguo deja de funcionar, así que "
"copia el nuevo en tu servicio receptor (Slack, Zapier, tu endpoint). Déjalo "
"en blanco para desactivar la verificación de firma."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:2686
msgid ""
"A shared secret BuddyNext uses to sign outgoing webhooks (HMAC-SHA256) and "
"to verify inbound access requests at POST buddynext/v1/webhook/access. "
"Click Generate for a strong secret, copy it into your receiving service "
"(Slack, Zapier, your endpoint), then Save. Leave blank to disable signature "
"verification."
msgstr ""
"Un secreto compartido que BuddyNext usa para firmar webhooks salientes "
"(HMAC-SHA256) y verificar solicitudes de acceso entrantes en POST "
"buddynext/v1/webhook/access. Haz clic en Generar para obtener un secreto "
"fuerte, cópialo en tu servicio receptor (Slack, Zapier, tu endpoint), luego "
"Guardar. Déjalo en blanco para desactivar la verificación de firma."

